OL,3,GNEWSANomadic life for Irish Travellers
OL,4,A'at risk' over site shortages
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe nomadic life of Irish Travellers is
OL,7,F"at risk" in Northern Ireland with
OL,8,Fmembers of the community feeling
OL,9,Fpressured to move into "bricks and
OL,10,Fmortar" housing, a support group has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FThe number of sites and pitches in
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland has "reduced
OL,15,Fdrastically" in the past 20 years,
OL,16,Faccording to the Craigavon Travellers
OL,17,FSupport Committee.
OL,19,FIt added that the issue was
OL,20,F"compounded" by "well below par"
OL,21,Fprovisions on remaining sites.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
