OL,3,GNEWSANomadic life for Irish Travellers
OL,4,A'at risk' over site shortages
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland Housing Executive
OL,7,F(NIHE), which is responsible for the
OL,8,Faccommodation needs of travellers, said
OL,9,Fit is investing in and future-proofing
OL,10,Ftheir way of life.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
